				tidy-1.0.tar.gz
				tidy-1.0.lsm
Alternate-site:	tsx-11.mit.edu /pub/linux/sources/sbin
Original-site:  saftsack.fs.uni-bayreuth.de /pub/tidy
Platforms:      Unix machine with syslogd and perl v5
Copying-policy: GPL
