file CREDITS for details); in particular, Andreas Schwab
<schwab@issan.informatik.uni-dortmund.de>, Marty Leisner
<leisner@sdsp.mc.xerox.com>, Juergen Weigert
<jnweiger@immd4.informatik.uni-erlangen.de> Linus Torvalds
<Linus.Torvalds@cs.Helsinki.FI>, Michael E Chastain
<mec@duracef.shout.net>, and Thomas Bogendoerfer <tsbogend@bigbug.franken.de>.

